<title>JAPAN: Nikkato -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nikkato -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  3.27		vs	    3.09</p>
<p> Operating	  137    million	  vs	  186    million</p>
<p> Current	    136    million	  vs	  183    million</p>
<p> Net		   68    million	  vs	   44    million</p>
<p> EPS		    6.95 yen	  vs	    4.47 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     10 million	  vs	  10 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nikkato Corp manufactures industrial porcelain.</p>
</text>
